00:05:05.720 --> 00:05:06.840
that are

00:05:07.720 --> 00:05:08.680
maintain

00:05:08.680 --> 00:05:18.405
smaller dollar values that the town funds just a couple of times a year, like the Board of Fire Commissioners, for instance, and also the library board,

00:05:18.645 --> 00:05:23.045
